# Request examples for the Make scenario. This is NOT an importable Make blueprint.
# Use only a destination you are authorized to publish to.
@baseUrl = https://YOUR-ASSIGNED-DOMAIN.ngrok-free.app
@makeToken = COPY_THE_PRIVATE_MAKE_API_TOKEN_HERE
@publicationId = CONTENT_ID:REVISION:CHANNEL
@digest = COPY_THE_64_CHARACTER_DIGEST_HERE

### Fetch approved jobs (this never approves content)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/make/jobs?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{makeToken}}
ngrok-skip-browser-warning: true

### Claim immediately before posting; stop on any non-2xx response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/make/jobs/{{publicationId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{makeToken}}
ngrok-skip-browser-warning: true
Content-Type: application/json

{"digest":"{{digest}}"}

### Report confirmed platform success (map attempt from the claim response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/make/jobs/{{publicationId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{makeToken}}
ngrok-skip-browser-warning: true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "digest": "{{digest}}",
  "attempt": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "external_id": "ACTUAL_PLATFORM_POST_ID",
  "url": "https://ACTUAL_PLATFORM_PUBLICATION_URL"
}

### Report a definite failure: no platform post was created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/make/jobs/{{publicationId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{makeToken}}
ngrok-skip-browser-warning: true
Content-Type: application/json

{"digest":"{{digest}}","attempt":1,"status":"failed","error_code":"PLATFORM_401"}

### Report an uncertain outcome; never blindly repeat the platform write
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/make/jobs/{{publicationId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{makeToken}}
ngrok-skip-browser-warning: true
Content-Type: application/json

{"digest":"{{digest}}","attempt":1,"status":"uncertain","error_code":"PLATFORM_TIMEOUT"}
